         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddaf81-1c60-58c2-e063-6394a90a57d2">
               <id root="5dddaf81-1c5f-58c2-e063-6394a90a57d2"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Helps improve the appearance of toenails affected by fungal infection,including discoloration, thickening,splitting, crumbling, and brittleness.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddb0e6-6839-5bf2-e063-6394a90a4ea0">
               <id root="5dddb0e6-6838-5bf2-e063-6394a90a4ea0"/>
               <code code="34071-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="WARNINGS SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>For external use only.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddb49d-2fde-5d6f-e063-6394a90a8476">
               <id root="5dddb49d-2fdd-5d6f-e063-6394a90a8476"/>
               <code code="50570-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - DO NOT USE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Do not use on broken or severely irritated skin.
  <br/>
Do not use on children under 2 years of age except under the advice and supervision of a doctor.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddb65d-ec9e-f381-e063-6294a90a3f57">
               <id root="5dddb65d-ec9d-f381-e063-6294a90a3f57"/>
               <code code="50567-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - WHEN USING SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>When using this product,avoid contact with eyes. If eye contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddb998-f797-f4a9-e063-6294a90ad925">
               <id root="5dddb998-f796-f4a9-e063-6294a90ad925"/>
               <code code="50566-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - STOP USE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Stop use and ask a doctor if irritation occurs or if there is no improvement within 2 weeks.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddbba6-22a0-62f9-e063-6394a90a110a">
               <id root="5dddbba6-229f-62f9-e063-6394a90a110a"/>
               <code code="50565-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Keep out of reach of children.If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5dddc050-0239-6425-e063-6394a90a47f3">
               <id root="5dddc050-0238-6425-e063-6394a90a47f3"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Clean and thoroughly dry the affected area.
  <br/>
Apply a thin layer to the affected toenail and surrounding skin twice daily, in the morning and evening.
  <br/>
Pay special attention to the spaces between the toes.
  <br/>
Wear well-fitting, ventilated shoes and change shoes and socks at least once daily.
  <br/>
Use for 2 weeks, or as directed by a doctor.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261015"/>
            </section>
         </component>
